===Alternative forms===
* [[racket]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɹækɪt/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ækɪt|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|raquette}}, from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|رَاحَة||palm of the hand}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An implement with a handle connected to a round frame strung with [[wire]], [[sinew]], or [[plastic]] cords, and used to hit a ball, such as in [[tennis]], or a [[shuttlecock]] in [[badminton]].

